<title>Iraq: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/iraq/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-iraq-2026-11-20T13:19:56.389Z</guid>
<pubDate>Fri, 20 Nov 2026 13:19:56 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Iraqi security forces and the Iran-backed militia Kataib Hezbollah have finalized a compromise that creates a joint security command in the Jurf al-Nasr and Jurf al-Sakhar areas, while Prime Minister Ali al-Zaidi has ordered a separate command for the same region. Iraqi officials arrested the chief of an oil pipeline on smuggling allegations, linking the dispute to alleged US pressure. French nationals received life sentences for joining ISIL and French ISIS propagandists are on trial in Iraq. The UCDP recorded 396 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.france24.com/en/middle-east/20261120-iraqi-security-forces-to-deploy-in-hezbollah-stronghold-under-compromise-deal&quot;&gt;France 24&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.aljazeera.com/video/newsfeed/2026/11/20/kataib-hezbollah-faces-deadline-to-leave-iraqi-stronghold?traffic_source=rss&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.france24.com/en/video/20261120-iraqi-forces-strike-compromise-with-powerful-pro-iran-militia&quot;&gt;France 24&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMizAFBVV95cUxPV3p3ekUySC1lT1U3N1A5azB2VFVYbjVEcTIwcG1SdE9RXzU1QVBTb29YTDhreFJaUXkxaEtCbzlIazZaazVQNW15QnNocUU5SE5FSXBDc0lpTk9hQlhuM0o4TlMzVHhyemRRR2hWQUhIYUJXRkFBVzc0czQxOTl5RHloZkx5Y2VnX2xScGpwU0pnMGo5RHZCWHVGUUw2UHB3cXAtbTdfRDBrNGkzbG5LakF3MXBuNjdVZy13RWJJWHFUN3NaRGlFVzY3Q2k?oc=5&quot;&gt;Reuters&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.euronews.com/2026/11/19/iraq-orders-armed-factions-to-withdraw-from-strategic-area-amid-alleged-oil-smuggling-and-&quot;&gt;euronews.com&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description>
</item>
